===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|schal}} (infinitive {{m|enm|schulen}}), from {{inh|en|ang|sċeal}} (infinitive {{m|ang|sċulan||should, must}}), from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*skulan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*skal}} (infinitive {{m|gem-pro|*skulaną}}), from {{der|en|ine-pro|*skel-||to owe, be under obligation}}.

Cognate with {{cog|sco|sall}}, {{m|sco|sal||shall}}, {{cog|frr|skal}}, {{m|frr|schal}}, {{cog|stq|skäl}}, {{m|stq|schäl}}, {{m|stq|schal}} (infinitive {{m|stq|skälle}}, {{m|stq|schälle}}), {{cog|fy|sil}} (infinitive {{m|fy|sille||shall}}), {{cog|nl|zal}} (infinitive {{m|nl|zullen||shall}}), {{cog|af|sal}}, {{cog|nds|schall}} (infinitive {{m|nds-de|schölen||shall}}), {{cog|de|soll}} (infinitive {{m|de|sollen||ought to}}), {{cog|da|skal}} (infinitive {{m|da|skulle||shall}}), {{cog|is|skal}} (infinitive {{m|is|skulu|t=shall}}), {{cog|sv|skall||shall}} (infinitive {{m|sv|skola}}).

